  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive Eye Health for marginalised communities, Papua New Guinea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CBM (Christian Blind Mission International) will bring key stakeholders together to strengthen and deliver decentralised inclusive eye health services to marginalised communities in PNG, primarily focused on the Highlands Region. The activity will complement the inclusive education efforts of CBM&#x2019;s Manaaki Round One activity and build national eye health capability, strengthen inclusion, improve health and education outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
